    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23联考）轨道交通公司定期进行轨道检修工作，甲、乙两个工程队合作进行需4小时完成，甲队单独完成比乙队单独完成快15小时，则甲队单独完成需要的时间是：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "5小时"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "6小时"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "7小时"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "8小时"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          60
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          54
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-08-p060.webp",
            "alt": "工程问题 · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第54页",
            "pdfPage": 60
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-08-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-08",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设甲单独需t小时，则乙需t＋15小时。总量设为1，合作4小时完成，所以1/t＋1/(t＋15)＝1/4。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "整理得t²＋7t－60＝0，即(t－5)(t＋12)＝0。工时必须为正，所以t＝5。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "甲5小时、乙20小时的效率和为1/4，符合题意，选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "已知单独时间差时用倒数表示效率，不把工时直接相加。"
        }
      ],
